WEBVTT

00:05:28.574 --> 00:05:30.409
I said, "Yeah, actually, it's not.

00:05:30.409 --> 00:05:31.577
It's my seat."

00:05:31.619 --> 00:05:32.620
(Laughter)

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:33.954
"1D, 1D.

00:05:34.372 --> 00:05:37.666
But I'll be glad to hold your stuff
until you find your seat."

00:05:38.084 --> 00:05:39.877
He said, "What do I have to tell you?

00:05:39.877 --> 00:05:41.045
That is my seat."

00:05:41.087 --> 00:05:42.338
I said, "Yeah, it's not."

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.673
(Laughter)

00:05:44.715 --> 00:05:46.592
At which point the guy behind me said,

00:05:46.592 --> 00:05:47.843
"Lady,

00:05:47.885 --> 00:05:51.514
would you take your effing argument
elsewhere so I can get in the airplane?"

00:05:52.556 --> 00:05:55.643
I was absolutely stunned.

00:05:56.018 --> 00:05:59.188
I had never been treated
like that as a male.